title: Streetfighting
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: streetfighting_timer = 6; month_actions += 1; rfb_militarization_cost = 2 if rfb_militancy > 0.1 else rfb_militarization_cost = 1; rfb_militarization_cost = 3 if rfb_militancy > 0.25; strife += 1
view-if: year >= 1930 and sa_strength >= 150 and streetfighting_timer == 0 and not return_to_normalcy
card-image: img/blutmai_2.jpg
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

= Streetfighting

Battles rage on the streets between the Nazi SA, nationalist Stahlhelm, communist Rotfrontkämpferbund (RFB), and the Reichsbanner. In some parts of the country, conditions are nearing civil war levels, as dozens of people are killed each month.

We must do something to protect the workers against these predations.

- @battle: Test our defense units in battle against the fascists!
- @arm_rfb: Increase training and armaments for the Rotfrontkämpferbund.
- @antifa_training: Increase cooperation between Antifaschistische Aktion and our paramilitaries.
- @truce_rfb: Try to make peace with the RFB.
- @easy_discard

@battle
view-if: rfb_militancy > 0.5
on-arrival: rfb_militancy += 0.1; sa_strength += 40; rfb_strength -= 10; 
max-visits: 1

Our forces have taken some loses with some even quit. However, the remainder are toughened as a result. Our confrontations also provide ample recruiting material for the Nazi SA.

@arm_rfb
subtitle: -[+ rfb_militarization_cost +] resource
choose-if: resources >= rfb_militarization_cost
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ rfb_militarization_cost +] needed).
on-arrival: resources -= rfb_militarization_cost; rfb_militancy += 0.06; rfb_strength += 50; sa_strength += 50

We have increased training and purchased more armaments for the Rotfrontkämpferbund.


@antifa_training
view-if: antifa_formed == 1
on-arrival: rfb_militancy += 0.03; rfb_strength += 25; sa_strength += 15; 
max-visits: 2

We expand Antifaschistische Aktion, recruiting more workers into it and our other defense organizations.

@truce_rfb
choose-if: spd_relation >= 45
view-if: kpd_truce == 0
unavailable-subtitle: The KPD is not interested.
on-arrival: kpd_truce = 1; spd_relation += 5; rfb_strength += 50; rb_strength += 50; sa_strength += 50;

We have made at least a temporary truce with the SPD, so that our respective paramilitaries will stop fighting.
